OL,3,GNEWSAFurther arrest in A1(M) crash
OL,4,Amurder investigation
OL,5,
OL,6,FA woman has been arrested in connection
OL,7,Fwith a fatal crash on the A1(M) in
OL,8,FNorth Yorkshire.
OL,10,FElena Chiriac, 22, from Newcastle, died
OL,11,Fwhen a silver Ford Transit and a silver
OL,12,FVolkswagen Golf collided on the
OL,13,Fsouthbound carriageway on 4 October in
OL,14,Fthe Barton area, north of Scotch
OL,15,FCorner.
OL,17,FPolice said the 52-year-old woman, from
OL,18,FNewcastle, had been arrested on
OL,19,Fsuspicion of encouraging or assisting
OL,20,Fthe commission of an assault offences
OL,21,Fand had been released on bail.
OL,23,APub: 15-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,388,380,200,160,0,100
